+# HAL Engine tool input validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+Tool inputs arrive from model generated calls and must meet the schema declared by the tool before executor code handles them.
+
+## Execution
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` checks input against the resolved tool definition's `inputSchema` before calling the executor; when a required property is missing, it returns a `ToolResponse` describing the failure and does not invoke the executor ([validated by: rejects missing required tool input before calling the executor](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L4)).
